// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1791150957" "Shut yer trap, ye scurvy dog!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1874723052" "I'll put me boot in yer face if ye don't shut it!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1533236535" "If ye don't shut yer mouth about diggin', I'll keelhaul ye!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_DIGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2005675731" "You'll not be lootin' this bounty, you lily-livered cur!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_DIGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1563183591" "Avast!  Don't let them get the loot!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1452465468" "Avast, ye dogs!  This booty'll no bury itself!  Dig!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3703890368" "Put yer backs into it, mateys!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1085418464" "Oh come on, ye swabbies!  Me gran can dig better than that!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P24989087" "Ahhh, me gentlemen of fortune, 'tis a lovely night for buryin' some silver!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3877443435" "Stop swingin' the lead and start yer diggin'!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2769392128" "Stow that jaw waggin', ye gobs, and dig!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P205411135" "Dig!  And do it smartly!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3190532214" "Hang 'em from the yardarm!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P119484573" "Avast, ye sea dogs!  They're after the booty!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3640269718" "Make 'em walk the plank!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1296661257" "Ye'll no touch our treasure, ye bilge rat!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1192739880" "Ye horn swogglin' scurvy cur!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_TREASURE_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P940350738" "Aye, the Red Hands'll be pleased with this booty to be sure."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3011435438" "Aye, tis a quiet eve, cap'n."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3582091240" "'Tis a clear sky tonight."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3720116833" "Aye, mateys, the moon is bright tonight."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3377741972" "Soon we'll head back to the ship.  Soon."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P650383599" "You'll be sorry if you don't stop lollygagging.  Keep a strong watch, swabbie!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3193546764" "Ye'll no take the Fort!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3532679833" "To arms, me hearties!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3260639406" "Ye scurvy landlubbers!  Attack!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P581977708" "Make em dance the hempen jig!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1990588776" "Eh, Stripey, ye think we'll be here long?"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P763466279" "Me arms are sore."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3008983983" "The Fort.  'Tis a beauty.  Even in cuffs."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1307889484" "Even stuck to th' wall, 'tis a lovely night."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2211430545" "'Tis a desperate night to be waitin' for mercy from the Red Hands."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3501648689" "Shiver me timbers!  Ye scurvy dog!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2765354825" "A traitor, you be!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_MANACLES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3603756923" "Scallywag!"

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3455666463" "Watch fer signs 'o trouble, mateys."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3012661979" "Stow it, ye scallywags.  'Tis a quiet patrol."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2615591663" "Do ye feel somethin'?  'Tis in the air."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P486104226" "T'arms, men!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P209570913" "By the powers, we got traitors!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_GHOSTPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3016459300" "T'arms, me hearties!"

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_GHOSTSHIP_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2810695332" "We'll no be gettin' this wreck fixed by morn."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_GHOSTSHIP_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2649601756" "It be the sirens, mates.  We'll no make it out of 'ere now."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_GHOSTSHIP_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P458152913" "Do ye see anythin'?  'Tis always dark!"




